1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:07,280
This trade has a stop loss and a take profit.

2
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:11,480
To remove the stop loss, right-click the trade and choose Stop.

3
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:17,600
Click Remove. There is no confirmation, so be sure first.

4
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:23,390
The stop loss is gone. The trade is no longer protected below.

5
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:27,620
The take profit works the same way: choose Limit.

6
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:33,230
Click Remove.

7
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:37,730
Now the trade has neither. You can also remove them on the chart with the X on their label.

